WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
[chanting]

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:07.833
Richmond til we die!

00:00:07.833 --> 00:00:09.375
We're Richmond til we die!

00:00:09.375 --> 00:00:10.875
We know we are, we're sure we
are.

00:00:10.875 --> 00:00:12.458
We're Richmond til we die!

00:00:12.583 --> 00:00:15.542
Richmond til we die!

00:00:15.542 --> 00:00:16.333
We know we are,

00:00:16.333 --> 00:00:19.000
We're sure we are!

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.458
We're Richmond til we die!

00:00:20.458 --> 00:00:21.500
Go Richmond!

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:24.125
[all cheering]

00:00:24.125 --> 00:00:25.500
[music starts]

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:27.750
This is Roy Kent. This is Season
Three.

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:28.958
[clappers]

00:00:28.958 --> 00:00:30.083
Let's go!

00:00:30.083 --> 00:00:30.833
Let's go, come on!

00:00:30.833 --> 00:00:31.417
Let's go!

00:00:31.417 --> 00:00:32.208
[door opens]

00:00:32.208 --> 00:00:32.833
Let's go, Coach.

00:00:34.375 --> 00:00:38.625
Making this show has brought a
great deal of fulfillment, for
me personally.

00:00:38.625 --> 00:00:40.792
And sometimes it'll bring tears
to my eyes.

00:00:40.792 --> 00:00:41.542
We're going to do that again.

00:00:41.542 --> 00:00:44.250
Sometimes it'll give me
goosebumps sometimes it'll just
make you warm.

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:45.375
-Did not see that coming.
-[laughing]

00:00:45.375 --> 00:00:45.625
[laughing]

00:00:45.625 --> 00:00:50.458
It's funny, thinking about the
things in your life that can
make you cry just knowing that they existed.

00:00:50.458 --> 00:00:51.542
[Brett Goldstein]
We're the luckiest people in the
world.

00:00:51.542 --> 00:00:53.208
If it were up to me we'd never
do anything else.

00:00:53.208 --> 00:00:54.125
That's it, balance.

00:00:54.208 --> 00:00:55.833
[laughing]

00:00:55.833 --> 00:00:58.583
Let's go find a windmill!

00:01:00.792 --> 00:01:03.292
We are coming right to the end,
aren't we?

00:01:03.292 --> 00:01:04.000
Yes.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:07.167
It's been a long road, this
season.

00:01:07.167 --> 00:01:09.333
[applause]

00:01:09.333 --> 00:01:12.333
My appreciation of the cast has
only deepened.

00:01:12.333 --> 00:01:13.625
[applause]

00:01:13.625 --> 00:01:16.667
It's funny because you develop
these friendships as real
people,

00:01:16.667 --> 00:01:19.750
James Lance:
but then there's also your
friendships you have as the characters as well,

00:01:19.750 --> 00:01:21.833
James Lance:
which is like a double whammy of
friendship.

00:01:22.375 --> 00:01:23.792
That's good. That was good.

00:01:23.792 --> 00:01:26.500
I didn't mean a word of that,
but I just thought it sounded
good.

00:01:27.208 --> 00:01:28.500
David Elsendoorn:
They're all suckers, I hate
them.

00:01:28.875 --> 00:01:30.000
[laughing]

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.417
Toheeb Jimoh:
They're like, yeah like family.
Like my brothers.

00:01:32.417 --> 00:01:33.333
Richmond on three.

00:01:33.333 --> 00:01:36.167
[laughing]

00:01:36.167 --> 00:01:38.167
It's such a happy, silly gaggle.

00:01:38.167 --> 00:01:40.167
[laughing]

00:01:40.167 --> 00:01:44.083
And that is an almost entirely
unique circumstance to find
yourself in.

00:01:44.083 --> 00:01:45.417
Oh I love you.

00:01:45.667 --> 00:01:49.083
Being able to play out this
friendship on camera and off
camera,

00:01:49.125 --> 00:01:50.750
That was, sensational.

00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:54.167
Juno Temple:
has been a beautiful, magic
whirlwind.

00:01:54.292 --> 00:01:56.750
[both laughing]

00:01:57.542 --> 00:02:01.083
This show is bringing so much
happiness and joy to everyone.

00:02:01.083 --> 00:02:02.000
[cheering]

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:05.833
It has been the most wonderful
experience. It's like a big
family.

00:02:05.833 --> 00:02:09.208
It's just so good to be a part
of, even though I'm the villain.

00:02:09.208 --> 00:02:11.417
[laughing]

00:02:11.417 --> 00:02:14.625
I think we're all slightly nicer
people than we were at the
beginning of the job.

00:02:15.333 --> 00:02:15.958
Nice.

00:02:15.958 --> 00:02:17.583
God I hate what you've done to
me.

00:02:17.625 --> 00:02:22.292
[somber music plays]

00:02:22.292 --> 00:02:24.167
-Yeah.
-This is, this is it. This is
it.

00:02:24.167 --> 00:02:27.792
This is the last day on Ted
Lasso Season 3.

00:02:29.042 --> 00:02:31.042
I'm in full denial. Full.

00:02:31.208 --> 00:02:36.125
[all talking]

00:02:36.125 --> 00:02:39.833
I don't think anyone can really
believe it, process it.

00:02:39.958 --> 00:02:40.875
Toheeb Jimoh:
I don't think I'm gonna cry.

00:02:41.083 --> 00:02:42.417
-Nope.
-[laughter]

00:02:42.417 --> 00:02:44.750
We'll come back to the end of
the day, and this man is
bawling.

00:02:44.750 --> 00:02:45.958
-We'll come back at the end of
the day, and this man is
bawling. -He's crying.

00:02:45.958 --> 00:02:47.917
We're at the end of it, and if
you can see behind me-

00:02:47.917 --> 00:02:51.792
Last year we did NSYNC "Bye
Bye Bye," this year we're doing
"So Long, Farewell."

00:02:52.042 --> 00:02:58.833
♪ There's a sad sort of clanging
from the clock in the hall, and
the bells in the steeple, too. ♪

00:02:58.833 --> 00:02:59.792
[cheering]

00:02:59.792 --> 00:03:03.875
The team organized a farewell
song for Ted,

00:03:03.875 --> 00:03:06.458
Kola Bokinni:
to show how much
they appreciate him.

00:03:06.583 --> 00:03:09.625
♪ Coo-coo, coo-coo. ♪

00:03:09.625 --> 00:03:13.667
I believe when I asked to do it,
you see some of the boys like,
kinda, rejecting it a little bit.

00:03:13.667 --> 00:03:14.375
[ball impacts]
Ow!

00:03:14.375 --> 00:03:15.958
This is really distracting my
process.

00:03:16.042 --> 00:03:17.875
And then by the end of it
everyone's like-

00:03:17.875 --> 00:03:19.333
Five, six, seven, eight.

00:03:19.333 --> 00:03:21.250
♪ So long, farewell. ♪

00:03:21.250 --> 00:03:23.708
It's one of the final moments in
our third season.

00:03:23.708 --> 00:03:26.958
And a very powerful and touching
moment.

00:03:26.958 --> 00:03:29.583
♪ Adieu. ♪

00:03:29.583 --> 00:03:32.333
[applause]

00:03:32.333 --> 00:03:36.583
It gets to your heart, to your
funny bones, all bits of you.

00:03:36.583 --> 00:03:45.375
♪ Goodbye. ♪

00:03:46.667 --> 00:03:48.250
-That was nice.
-I think we nailed it!

00:03:48.250 --> 00:03:50.708
Thank you, fellas. That was
perfect.

00:03:50.708 --> 00:03:53.208
[cheering]

00:03:53.875 --> 00:03:57.125
Rebecca:
I can afford to make you
one of the highest paid coaches in the league.

00:03:58.083 --> 00:04:00.083
I know people say I'm crazy,
but-

00:04:03.375 --> 00:04:06.375
I still think I'd be underpaying
you for what you mean to this
club.

00:04:07.958 --> 00:04:09.333
Will you please stay?

00:04:12.875 --> 00:04:18.458
If you're not ready to stop
being with someone, I don't
really know how to cope with it.

00:04:18.792 --> 00:04:20.958
I've loved getting to know each
and every single one of you.

00:04:20.958 --> 00:04:22.625
[laughing]

00:04:22.625 --> 00:04:24.958
Ted:
Learning all about the men
you were,

00:04:25.375 --> 00:04:29.125
and getting a front row
seat to see the men you're all
becoming.

00:04:29.583 --> 00:04:33.750
I can't really talk about it
because I'll cry, so it's very
much still time for everyone.

00:04:36.458 --> 00:04:38.875
It's a series of teary goodbyes.

00:04:38.875 --> 00:04:41.750
We've all been on this journey
the exact same way as the fans.

00:04:42.083 --> 00:04:43.125
I'm gonna cry.

00:04:43.125 --> 00:04:48.708
[crying and laughing]

00:04:48.958 --> 00:04:52.917
Goodbye, Ted. I owe you and this show
so much.

00:04:52.917 --> 00:04:54.458
Nick Mohammed:
So thank you, Ted.

00:04:54.458 --> 00:04:56.583
Genuinely makes me a bit-

00:04:56.583 --> 00:04:57.583
See you later, Ted.

00:04:57.583 --> 00:04:58.292
Adios, amigo.

00:04:58.750 --> 00:04:59.792
Bye, Ted.

00:04:59.792 --> 00:05:02.000
Stop talking, change the
subject.

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:03.583
Boss don't wanna talk about it
yet.

00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:04.875
I'm right there with you.

00:05:04.958 --> 00:05:05.667
Goodbye, Ted.

00:05:05.792 --> 00:05:06.750
Goodbye, Ted.

00:05:06.958 --> 00:05:07.542
Love ya.

00:05:07.625 --> 00:05:08.333
Been amazing.

00:05:08.667 --> 00:05:09.625
Goodbye, Ted!

00:05:09.917 --> 00:05:12.042
It was great knowing you.
Wanker.

00:05:12.375 --> 00:05:14.417
Ted:
Getting to work with you all
these last three years,

00:05:14.625 --> 00:05:17.167
has truly been one of the
greatest experiences of my life.

00:05:17.792 --> 00:05:20.292
Ted:
I'm just so gosh damn proud
to be a part of this team.

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:24.125
Ted goes home, but we will be
together forever.

00:05:24.125 --> 00:05:25.083
[laughing]

00:05:25.083 --> 00:05:25.958
I love you Ted.

00:05:25.958 --> 00:05:27.125
I love you too, Willis.

00:05:27.500 --> 00:05:30.208
I've personally never been great
at goodbyes, so-

00:05:30.208 --> 00:05:34.250
Jason Sudeikis:
I wish for everybody to live
with the experience of making this show and being a part of it

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:35.750
with the spirit in which it was
created.

00:05:36.167 --> 00:05:37.208
I love you guys.

00:05:37.792 --> 00:05:38.750
And I'm gonna miss you all.

00:05:39.042 --> 00:05:43.333
Ted gave us the Lasso Way, and
we can go forth and preach it.

00:05:43.333 --> 00:05:45.167
[music swells]

00:05:45.167 --> 00:05:48.833
♪

00:05:48.833 --> 00:05:51.625
A lot of folks like to say
there's no place like home.

00:05:52.125 --> 00:05:52.750
And that's true,

00:05:56.458 --> 00:05:59.000
But there ain't a whole lot of
places like AFC Richmond,
either.

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:01.875
[cheering]

00:06:02.875 --> 00:06:04.333
I love you guys so very much.

00:06:04.333 --> 00:06:05.042
On three.

00:06:05.042 --> 00:06:06.500
One, two, three-

00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:08.375
I love you guys so very much!

00:06:08.375 --> 00:06:11.292
[cheering]

